<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Notes shall be same as filed under Quick Results i.e in PDF submission.   Current Tax contains amount of Tax adjustment of earlier years of Rs. 1.48 Crores      Following are notes pertaining to Cash Flow Indirect excel sheet (statement):      1. Adjustments for decrease (increase) in other non-current assets includes Increase in Financial assets and non-current assets of Rs. 62.90 Cr. and Decrease in Lease deposits-net of Rs. 3.76 Cr.   2. Other adjustments for which cash effects are investing or financing cash flow includes (Profit) / Loss on sale of property, plant and equipment of Rs. 0.42 Cr. , Loss on sale of investments in shares of Rs. 1.98 Cr. and Profit from sale of mutual fund investments of Rs. 2.86 Cr.   3. Other adjustments to reconcile profit (loss) includes Covid-19-Related Rent Concessions of Rs. 176.83 Cr.   4. Other adjustments for non-cash items includes Allowance for doubtful debts / advances of Rs. 0.45 Cr, Gain on account of remeasurement in lease term of Rs. 32.33 Cr. and Interest(time value) recognized on interest free lease deposit of Rs. 11.56 Cr.   5. Proceeds from sales of other long-term assets includes Net proceeds from sale of investment in FRL of Rs. 57.69 Cr. and Proceeds from sale of investments in mutual funds of Rs. 467.11 Cr.   6. Purchase of other long-term assets includes Investment in Fixed Deposit of Rs. 29 Cr. and Purchase of investments in mutual funds of Rs. 437.99 Cr.   7. Proceeds from issuing shares includes Proceeds from issue of equity shares of Rs. 10.69 Cr., Securities premium on issue of share capital of Rs. 288.48 Cr. and Share issue expenses of 3.21 Cr.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
